{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-04",
  "title": "城市的呼吸",
  "storyCode": "10-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7809c54ddbec85299850bea857badb22261064b7cb88fb34399d1e90b27aae77",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:20 A.M. 天氣/陰\n距倫蒂尼姆五百二十七公里，廢棄礦場作業平台"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "停泊完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒什麼意外情況......呼，你是不是也能稍微休息一下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說，你準備馬上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......安靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......凱爾希女勳爵，好久不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這這這腐爛的味道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血魔。你竟然披著醫者的外袍......真稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "收起你的尖牙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就連最古老的紅眼魔都不敢觸碰我的血肉，他們都是膽小鬼，唯恐這些翻騰的怨怒會蝕爛他們的牙根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希，能讓我一下子控制不住本能的薩卡茲......有幾個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "至少你眼前這位算一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我已許久未見薩卡茲古老的英雄行走於大地之上。是什麼緣由令閣下來到這片荒地，食腐者的王？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以暫且當我是來拜訪老朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我們過去見過兩次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "第一次見時，你的樣貌還與如今有所不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於第二次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "在她出事那天，我在艦外看到了一道身影......那果然是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我以為食腐者的王庭已經做出了選擇，才會對那樣卑劣的刺殺袖手旁觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無論是當時還是現在，食腐者都只有一個選擇。我們是薩卡茲，我們只忠於薩卡茲，而不是王座和王冠，或者什麼古老的巫術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "過去數個世紀，我啖食了無數敵人的血肉，也數度見證了薩卡茲英雄的隕落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們有的死於強敵的劍戟之下，有的卻黯然消亡在故人的暗箭面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因此，我來這裡，就是想要一個答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告訴我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殺死了最後一隻純血溫迪戈的，是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "勳爵，回答我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希，你你你快讓Mon3tr出來啊！！他要動手了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本艦就在旁邊，我們不能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......食腐者之王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我不會在這裡與你戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "博卓卡斯替已經走出了困住他一生的樊籠，我不會用一場沒有結果的暴力玷污他最後的決心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是你口中祭奠一位薩卡茲英雄的方式嗎？這樣醜陋的......逃避？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我沒有逃避。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我給出了你要的回答，就如當初那位溫迪戈想要一場戰鬥來替代回答時一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "再說一次。食腐者之王，我拒絕與你在此動武。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你們啖下敵人的血肉，將他們的悲嚎與悔恨納入自己的身體，以此來作為下一次戰鬥的食糧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "而我們並不是敵人。我們有過並肩的時光，也會因暫時的立場不同而不得不刀劍相向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這同樣適用於當時的羅德島與整合運動的博卓卡斯替——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "就像你見證了她的逝去一樣，我見證了一位溫迪戈的精魂回歸卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說，你是那個見證者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是他自己選擇了你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "博卓卡斯替......在最後的時刻，他想要一位相稱的對手，也想要一位能夠對話的故友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。你的答案，我收下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你也出來吧，赦罪師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在剛才，要是我執意進攻......即便那頭漆黑的怪物不出來，你也會對我揮劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赦罪師的一劍，就算是我也會被抵擋一瞬......呵，如果你真的會令它完全出鞘的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "你知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我認識你們數百年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倒不如說，你會來到那個異族繼承者身邊，這一點有些出乎我的意料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忤逆的後果，你真能承擔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "......無關我能不能。自我出生起，那些罪孽就一直在我身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不錯！你比在倫蒂尼姆戴著面具的那個要有趣一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有那位年輕的大女妖。他不在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他雖然年輕，但被他母親教得很好。假如有他在，你們的勝算還會多上幾分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你的怒意已經淡去了，食腐者之王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這並不意味著我不想殺死你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我問你，這建於龐然古物遺骨之上的船筏，如今究竟還是不是流亡的魔王行營？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......我們從不曾以此自居，即便是她還在的時候都不曾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕那位異族繼承者已經率領眾臣前去倫蒂尼姆，你們還是不敢承認？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "阿米婭始終清楚自己的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我們不想任由一場戰爭在眼前發生。不該再有無謂的犧牲......無論是維多利亞人，還是薩卡茲，流的血已經夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可笑！一個軟弱到不敢以王自稱的異族稚兒，也敢妄想拯救薩卡茲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我未曾設想自己能站在這裡說服一位薩卡茲的王庭之主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想得還算清楚。想獲得眾王庭的承認，光憑你傳授的口舌之利可遠遠不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位異族的繼承者，她會在那座鐵製的堡壘裡經受前所未有的考驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "那麼，這就是你允許阿米婭進入倫蒂尼姆的原因？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "食腐者從戰爭中吸取養分，而失敗只會帶來無用的腐敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你對軍事委員會的決議能否為薩卡茲帶來勝利仍有疑慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "妄言！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（警惕的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......Mon3tr，不是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "食腐者之王，我並非在質疑薩卡茲軍隊的統率者。就像你說的，我只是在以故友的身份與你交談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "維多利亞的公爵們已將倫蒂尼姆圍得水洩不通，但特雷西斯依然能在城內召集群王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這恰恰說明，你與你的軍隊守著通往倫蒂尼姆的秘密要道，而你卻並未阻攔我們的靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "直到此刻，你也依然有機會殺了我，隨後毀去羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "但是你沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這正是因為......阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我親眼見到那頂黑冠之前，我又怎知她帶來的會是新生還是毀滅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你會看見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "她會超出你......不，超出我們所有人的想像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......朋友之間的交談到此為止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不老的勳爵，特立獨行的血魔，還有......離群的赦罪師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樣貌奇特的老者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們倫蒂尼姆見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......凱爾希，他走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不瞞你說，我剛才血液流速都變了。雖然我已經活了幾百年，但我還有很多事情沒有做完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "......在他眼中，正式的戰場在別處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "這是他放過羅德島的唯一理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還說什麼不想打回卡茲戴爾......我不去找麻煩，麻煩也會自己找上門啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_171_bldsk_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希，像這種情況，不能再發生了。否則的話，等你們離開以後，我很難保證羅德島的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我們是該啟程了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "閃靈，你的決定是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "......醫生，我和麗茲已經做好準備，我們很快就會動身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我注意到，剛才食腐者之王對你的指控，你並未否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "否認......沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "過去這三年裡，我們在羅德島的生活很平靜。這份平靜......無論對我還是對麗茲來說，都很難得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "那麼，到了告別的時刻了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "醫生，你很清楚，假如與我們同行，你和阿米婭會多一分危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_147_shining_1",
      "operatorId": "char_147_shining",
      "portraitKey": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "只是......如果羅德島需要我們，我們會在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "首領，S-309號防禦炮成功啟動了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來曼弗雷德取得了一些成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是否要向攝政王殿下彙報？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不需要。這些都在殿下的掌控中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想要取得王庭的信任，曼弗雷德還需要更多的實質性成績。抓住幾隊殘兵敗將和幾個探子還遠遠不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "副炮的啟動是第一步。告訴他，殿下需要的並不是一個甚至幾個無關緊要的地塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果有必要的話，那一整個區都可以捨棄......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站著別動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有敵人潛進來了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不想身首分離的話，別動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是一位意外的訪客啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你並不是很意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......換個說法。我們確實一直在等待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那艘船正停在倫蒂尼姆外面的某處荒野裡。我本以為你們此刻才剛抵達高牆之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過這也沒什麼好驚奇的。刺客的腳步總是比較快，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的廢話還是很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那還得歸功於你給了我廢話的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想動手的話，剛才為什麼不動手呢？你對陰影的控制已經嫺熟到了連我都無法第一時間發現的地步。還有你的呼吸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來，在離開殿下之後，你也從未疏於練習他教給你的技巧。殿下會感到欣慰的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......住口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情緒波動對一位刺客來說可沒有好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多麼靈巧的身手啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你確實......比其他幾個強很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是你沒有立刻行動的理由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一位赦罪師的性命還不值得你用自己的命來交換......我知道了，進城之後，你還沒有見過殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陰影沒有任何變化。它不會移動，更不會回答。\n赦罪師的視線穿過了那片空白，回到窗外。那裡同樣只有空白。\n一縷金芒從他紋絲不動的雙手間飄了起來，一同回到了窗外稀薄的日光裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等到了王座之前......你或許會撞見不止一位殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真期待你那時候的表情啊，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說，他們到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，攝政王殿下。我們的首領已在議事廳裡見到了他們中的一位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通知曼弗雷德。弄清楚他們都有誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "年輕的將軍應該已經見到我們的信使。可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他理應能處理這些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們理解您對曼弗雷德的信任，殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我不得不強調，他目前正忙於應對各方不死心的反抗者，從結果來看，他並沒有第一時間發現羅德島的靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說出你的人選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眾王對那位贗品一直心存興趣，除了已經有所行動的那兩位，血魔大君也已厭倦了與城內貴族的冗長應酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他很樂意前往薩迪恩區，助曼弗雷德一臂之力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提醒他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一旦發現“魔王”和{@nickname}，立刻帶他們來見我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位女勳爵呢？當然，食腐者之王會盯著她。但我們也需要做好準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓血魔自行處置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，殿下。大君會很期待的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "此外，首領想知道，您的周圍需不需要安排更多衛隊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不需要。如果有人想來找我，讓他們儘管來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有一事......假設“她”有與那群人會面的想法，我們是否應該加以干涉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓她去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，一旦“她”見到羅德島的那幾位故人......會不會有風險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是想到了這時候才提醒我，赦罪師的巫術並不牢靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請不要發怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像您看到的那樣，“她”的思想與行動都代表著薩卡茲的意志，這些意志......應當足以擊敗來自過去的殘存情感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_425_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但赦罪師存在的意義，就是為薩卡茲的未來排除潛在癥結。首領需要思考一切可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一具受困於牢籠中的傀儡無法在戰場上號令薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告訴赦罪師，我最多說一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別再用像上面這樣的說辭侮辱特蕾西婭......也別再侮辱我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位，走到這裡就差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有信號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這信號的意思是......呃，緊急會議？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是有什麼突發情況？！洛洛，我們得趕緊回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那這些人怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "指揮官的命令是把他們帶到這個位置，但現在她不會有空來見他們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "留下他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會不會太耽擱了？要不然這樣，我直接把他們帶去見指揮官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們還不能確認這些外來者就是那批人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不是他們還會是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這應該交由指揮官和幾位大隊長判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你擅作主張把他們帶進通道，還走了這麼遠，已經冒了很大的險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我試探過他們了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是挺聰明的，我承認，但你還是太容易相信人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再仔細看看你這些剛結識的朋友，尤其是那位也帶著無人機的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸欸？你是在說我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她是......薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是啊，我是薩卡茲，怎麼啦？這裡也不光我是薩卡茲啊，還有......\n唔唔唔？阿、阿米婭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，洛洛小姐，他們是薩卡茲，也是我們傾心信任的同伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們......與頭頂那些霸佔了你們家園的薩卡茲不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一樣還是不一樣，不是由你們說了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早說你不樂意跟我們相處，我們也用不著跟你們在這黑漆漆的管道裡鑽這麼久！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們是本地人。你們想留下的話，我會像歡迎每一位戰友一樣歡迎你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但我不能輕易相信他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......不管你怎麼說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們都是一起的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "在這裡的都是羅德島的幹員。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "每一個人都值得同等的信任。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就像博士說的這樣......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#18$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "洛洛小姐......我們剛才已經交換了許多資訊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#18$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "假如到目前為止，你們都不願意給予我們最基本的信任的話，我們也不必勉強一起走下去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "費斯特先生，羅德島會感謝您剛才的援手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "之後，我們會另外找路離開......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......等一下！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那個，洛洛她不是這個意思......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道。我多少能體會到洛洛小姐的情緒。沒有任何恨意是無來由的，我更不會也不能因此責怪她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "從過去到現在，羅德島一直在面臨類似的問題。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "無論是由於我們的感染者身份而無法信任我們，還是因為我們與薩卡茲站在一起而對我們的動機產生懷疑，對羅德島來說都是一樣的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們會用行動證明羅德島的立場。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是......也請你們理解，我們無法接受與這些異樣的眼光同行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "洛洛",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "洛洛",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你說得很好，卡特斯小姐，你是個很好的頭領。但這不會改變我的看法。我也要為我的戰友負責。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "洛洛",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "費斯特......隊長，我先走一步，通知大家做好準備。你真想好了的話，就帶這些人去見指揮官。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "洛洛",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "指揮官會做出判斷，到時候，不管她的命令是什麼，我都會遵守。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "洛洛！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿米婭，不會是我說錯話，導致我們跟他們的友誼破裂了吧......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒有，可露希爾，我們是不是朋友，這要看費斯特先生怎麼選。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "來吧，羅德島的朋友們。但願我的判斷沒有出錯......不然的話，我的副隊長一定不會放過我，我也沒臉再見指揮官。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那好，費斯特先生，我們會跟你走。正好，我也想見見你們的指揮官。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
